  "owner_statement": "D-P4.6-START: I, mayank-admin, accept P4.6 start package P4.6-START-R0 with SHA-256 2E1D5F921EB7C972192FE460D3B238F39D8D792C7869A8F338E291618314F779 and authorize its exact bounded local generated-only implementation scope, including the disabled unified-signal search projection, default-off OpenTelemetry-compatible adapters, generated C1/C10/C50 simulations, platform-neutral standalone/Kubernetes projections without Kubernetes execution, optional generated-only use of an already available local PostgreSQL/PostGIS test database, and local checkpoint commits without push. This does not authorize real telemetry, search, security, observability, or broker backends; production SLO/RPO/RTO/capacity targets; scanners; backup, restore, or recovery execution; hardware, performance, stress, or thermal testing; providers or operational network access; cameras or media; credentials or secrets beyond an opaque local test-database DSN; Government or private data; models, datasets, or inference; operational alerts or actions; containers or Kubernetes execution; deployment; or remote Git.",
